{
  "label": "sanadorm10",
  "title_zh": "",
  "lines": [
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "label sanadorm10:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I knock on Sana’s door and wait for her to answer.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Given that the last time she invited me into her room didn’t play out all that badly, I’m feeling a bit more confident this time than before and-",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene giantleapredux1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/giantleapredux1.webp",
      "alt": "giantleapredux1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Um...hi...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sana? I wasn’t done narrating yet. Why are you just coming out of your room without saying anything?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Because...umm...I figured that...you were going to come inside again if I didn’t...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is that not okay? Because there hasn’t really seemed to be any problem with that yet.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene giantleapredux2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/giantleapredux2.webp",
      "alt": "giantleapredux2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I know, but...it still feels a little weird...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I just think...I might feel more comfortable talking to you...if we’re not trapped inside of a...tiny box...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Aren’t you the one who doesn’t like going outside? This unexpected moment of character growth is putting me on my backfoot and I’m not sure if I like it.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene giantleapredux3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/giantleapredux3.webp",
      "alt": "giantleapredux3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well...I guess you’ll have time to figure it out then...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I sigh to myself and accept that I will not be hanging out in Sana’s room tonight.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I can’t hold it against her, though, as I probably wouldn’t feel comfortable with the lascivious gaze of someone twice my size bouncing off the walls of my room either.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So, where are we going? Do you have somewhere in mind?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If you could go anywhere in the world...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Where would you go?...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Anywhere in the world?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Anywhere at all.",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "We are swallowed by the dorm.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene 1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene roofday",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/BGs/roofday.png",
      "alt": "roofday"
    },
    {
      "en": "scene 2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene shrine_night",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/BGs/shrine_night.png",
      "alt": "shrine_night"
    },
    {
      "en": "scene 3",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene urbanparadise",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/BGs/urbanparadise.webp",
      "alt": "urbanparadise"
    },
    {
      "en": "scene 4",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene noonsky",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/BGs/noonsky.png",
      "alt": "noonsky"
    },
    {
      "en": "scene 5",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene emptyclassroom",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/BGs/emptyclassroom.png",
      "alt": "emptyclassroom"
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Somewhere I could be alone.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Alone?",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Somewhere no one could reach me.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Maybe the edge of the world?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I think...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I think that sounds nice.",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene giantleapredux4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/giantleapredux4.webp",
      "alt": "giantleapredux4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why don’t we go there, then?",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": To the edge of the universe.",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...Sana?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene giantleapredux5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/giantleapredux5.webp",
      "alt": "giantleapredux5"
    },
    {
      "en": "scene giantleapredux4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/giantleapredux4.webp",
      "alt": "giantleapredux4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why don’t we go there, then?",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": To the edge of the universe.",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": This is what you want, isn’t it?",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Would it look something like this?",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And if this doesn’t work, perhaps a different season?",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What? You can’t just-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene giantleapredux6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/giantleapredux6.webp",
      "alt": "giantleapredux6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Change the-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is this where you want to be?",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I can’t take us if I don’t know where to go, Sensei.",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I can’t take us if-",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene giantleapredux7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/giantleapredux7.webp",
      "alt": "giantleapredux7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sensei?...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is everything okay?...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You look kind of...pale, and-",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene giantleapredux8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/giantleapredux8.webp",
      "alt": "giantleapredux8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "LOST.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "PERHAPS YOU WOULD FARE BETTER WITHOUT THE DISTRACTION OF AN UNBLOSSOMED SLIT.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I can feel something moving around inside of my stomach.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "When I glance down at my hands, they appear smaller.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "A bench half illuminated by the sporadic dance of a flickering streetlight sits or stands or lays or kneels before me and I struggle to approach it.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Something crawls across my foot.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene giantleapredux9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/giantleapredux9.webp",
      "alt": "giantleapredux9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It must have been a cockroach.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh my.",
      "spk": "Strange Girl",
      "spkColor": "#FFFFFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’re early.",
      "spk": "Strange Girl",
      "spkColor": "#FFFFFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...What?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Who are you?...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Me?",
      "spk": "Strange Girl",
      "spkColor": "#FFFFFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I am no one.",
      "spk": "Strange Girl",
      "spkColor": "#FFFFFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I am simply passing by. The same as you, I’m sure.",
      "spk": "Strange Girl",
      "spkColor": "#FFFFFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": How lost the two of us are- chasing a light that seldom shines.",
      "spk": "Strange Girl",
      "spkColor": "#FFFFFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Turning into shadows under the glow of the moon and seeping into the earth as it makes moving that much easier.",
      "spk": "Strange Girl",
      "spkColor": "#FFFFFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But perhaps you’re even more lost than I am.",
      "spk": "Strange Girl",
      "spkColor": "#FFFFFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Listen, I don’t know where I am or...how I got here, but-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Don’t speak.",
      "spk": "Strange Girl",
      "spkColor": "#FFFFFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It will only make things harder.",
      "spk": "Strange Girl",
      "spkColor": "#FFFFFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I have a message for you.",
      "spk": "Strange Girl",
      "spkColor": "#FFFFFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...For me? From who?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Him.",
      "spk": "Strange Girl",
      "spkColor": "#FFFFFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": He says that the path you walk will be unlike the others.",
      "spk": "Strange Girl",
      "spkColor": "#FFFFFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": He says that you are special.",
      "spk": "Strange Girl",
      "spkColor": "#FFFFFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": He says He wants to meet you.",
      "spk": "Strange Girl",
      "spkColor": "#FFFFFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But He is unwilling to guide you. And you must find Him yourself.",
      "spk": "Strange Girl",
      "spkColor": "#FFFFFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Who are you talking about? How am I supposed to know who to find if-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Tick tock.",
      "spk": "Strange Girl",
      "spkColor": "#FFFFFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...What?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You can’t hear it?",
      "spk": "Strange Girl",
      "spkColor": "#FFFFFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It started counting down not too long ago.",
      "spk": "Strange Girl",
      "spkColor": "#FFFFFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I elect to remain quiet, not knowing how to reply to the fanatic ramblings of the mysterious, white-haired girl.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I half-expect her to go away, but she simply stares right back at me instead.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I listen for the ticking, but hear nothing.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Need to go back?",
      "spk": "Strange Girl",
      "spkColor": "#FFFFFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah. I was with someone just a moment ago.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’re with someone now as well.",
      "spk": "Strange Girl",
      "spkColor": "#FFFFFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The only difference is you can’t see-",
      "spk": "Strange Girl",
      "spkColor": "#FFFFFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene giantleapredux10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/giantleapredux10.webp",
      "alt": "giantleapredux10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Huh?",
      "spk": "Strange Girl",
      "spkColor": "#FFFFFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Where-",
      "spk": "Strange Girl",
      "spkColor": "#FFFFFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene giantleapredux11",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/giantleapredux11.webp",
      "alt": "giantleapredux11"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "The girl disappears just as quickly as she appeared in the first place.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "The pain in my stomach returns, but the movements cease as whatever is inside of me transitions to a state of dormancy.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "RETURN.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Return where? Who is-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene giantleapredux12",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/giantleapredux12.webp",
      "alt": "giantleapredux12"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Open the door.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene giantleapredux13",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/giantleapredux13.webp",
      "alt": "giantleapredux13"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": S...Sensei?...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hello.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I...didn’t think you...were coming back...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sorry.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I must have zoned out for a second.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But...that was...almost two hours ago...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Does that mean we can’t hang out now? Because I don’t really have anything else going on and I am afraid to go home.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We can, but...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I just...have to put my shoes on...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sounds good. I’ll wait out here.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Y...Yeah...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’ll...I’ll be right back...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
