    {
      "en": "scene giantleapredux14",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/giantleapredux14.webp",
      "alt": "giantleapredux14"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Sana and I decide to hang out outside of the dorms and everything is normal and okay.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So...you're positive that everything is...okay?...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": How many times are you going to ask that? I'm fine.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I've just...never seen anyone look that way before...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I was worried that...maybe I offended you by...asking if we could go outside instead of...staying in my room...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That's not something I'd be offended by. It's your room and if you want me to stay out of it, I'll stay out of it.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It's not...forever...it's just...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I...I want to know more about you first...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Which is why I asked about...where you'd want to go earlier...but...that...didn't really work out too well...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Did I even give you an answer?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene giantleapredux15",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/giantleapredux15.webp",
      "alt": "giantleapredux15"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Something about...the edge of the world, I think?...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I...still don't really understand what you meant by that, but...I think the point you were trying to make is that...you wanted to be alone...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What about you, then? Where would you go if you could choose anywhere at all?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Maybe...um...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Akihabara?...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You can choose anywhere in the world and your answer is that? That's like visiting a neighbor's house.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well...I've never been there before and...we can't leave Kumon-mi anymore...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We have...something similar not that far from here, but...it's a lot smaller and...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Should...should I pick something different?...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No, your answer is fine. I just expected something a little different, I guess.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I'm...pretty good at being different, I guess...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Actually, umm...now that I mention it...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": There's something I want to ask you...if that’s okay...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ask away.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, umm...We’ve been seeing each other more lately, and...and...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene giantleapredux16",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/giantleapredux16.webp",
      "alt": "giantleapredux16"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You don’t...have to answer this if you don’t want to...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s...a little weird, so...I would understand...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Just ask me. It’s fine.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Okay...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Then, umm...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What do you think I can do to seem...more normal?...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why do you ask, exactly?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It's just...hard to...connect with anyone when...I'm not sure what types of...ports they have or something...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Like...my wires won't fit because...they're outdated or...not the right brand...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Interesting time for a gaming analogy.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I just...want to...be less scared, I think...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And I don't want...anyone to think I'm...avoiding them on purpose...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hm.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I know I’m not helping myself by being so quiet, but...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That's just...how I am, I guess...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If that's who you are, why bother trying to be more normal in the first place?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do you actually want to change? Or do you just think changing will make your life more convenient?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene giantleapredux17",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/giantleapredux17.webp",
      "alt": "giantleapredux17"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": C-Convenient?",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What do you mean?...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, you only really talk to Ayane, right?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Right...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So, you probably think that if you had more friends or more people to talk to, things would be easier. But that's not true.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The more people you have in your life, the harder it gets to balance everything.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well...easier...isn’t really how I would put it...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Maybe just...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene giantleapredux16",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/giantleapredux16.webp",
      "alt": "giantleapredux16"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Actually...never mind...I don’t...really know where I’m going with this...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, whatever the case, I don’t think you should try to change who you are just because not enough people see you for you.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene giantleapredux17",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/giantleapredux17.webp",
      "alt": "giantleapredux17"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Huh?...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is that really all that hard to understand?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well...no...but...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It just kind of...sounded like a compliment...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That's probably because it was a compliment.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It might sound sappy, but I like you the way you are.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Besides, the world already has your mom, so there's really no need for you to start being outgoing or flirtatious.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene giantleapredux18",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/giantleapredux18.webp",
      "alt": "giantleapredux18"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Can we...stop talking about my mom so I can...return your compliment?...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sure. Go ahead.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I...umm...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I also...think you’re...a good person...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You're wrong. But thank you anyway.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Don’t say that, Sensei...You took your time getting to know me when it felt like...everyone else was either rushing or...not interested...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I think that makes you a really good person...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Again, thanks. But I can promise you there’s a lot more to me than just that.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Then...tell me...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": About you...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I want to know...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I hope to myself that the silence might help Sana understand that I don't want this.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I mean, how could I when I don't know the first thing about myself to begin with?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I can't share something I don't have. But I also can't come out and tell her that without the risk of breaking her heart just as she's finally starting to trust me.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "This is one of those times where silence is supposed to serve as an answer.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It just doesn't.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I'll...tell you more some other time, Sana.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I'm not really good at talking about myself.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That...makes two of us, then...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We can...improve together...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
